4. 決定や契約を変えたなら `dev/probes.json` の違反例も合わせ、`python3 <skill-foundation>/scripts/probe.py <skill>` を通す
5. `python3 <skill-foundation>/scripts/skill_lint.py <skill> --final --seal` を通す。通ると封印し直す
